1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,380
Need a medic?

2
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:18,760
I want a lawyer before I answer anything.

3
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:23,270
My back hurts. Can I move the chair?

4
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:34,190
You moved the bag, right? I need your name here too.

5
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,830
I'm sorry. They kept asking me the same thing.

6
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,130
I know. I called work.

7
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,550
I'm okay. It was the box.

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,700
Did they pay you?

9
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,700
They took my number.

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,700
A number for what?

11
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,260
They didn't say. I had to ask who to call.

12
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,700
Who sent you that?

13
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,550
Someone from work. It's already everywhere.

14
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:05,110
I should've been home. I'm the one who asked for that shift.

15
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:21,810
Will you call billing with me? I can't go through it all again on my own.

16
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,830
Can you start? Just say it's about the renewal.
